          "settings": {
            "title": "ORDERING AND PRODUCTS",
            "question_1": "Q: “Where are Jackson Vaughn candles made?”",
            "answer_1": "<p>Jackson Vaughn candles are hand poured and packaged in TX, USA.\n</p>",
            "question_2": "Q: “What are the ingredients in a Jackson Vaughn candle?”",
            "answer_2": "<p> Our candle formulas are crafted with care to ensure the best experience for our customers. We offer two wax blends: one is a blend of soy wax and a small amount of paraffin wax to enhance the fragrance throw, and the other is a luxurious soy and coconut wax blend. Both use a combination of natural and perfume-grade synthetic oils, paired with 100% natural cotton wicks for a clean and consistent burn. All of our candles are free of Phthalates and Parabens, reflecting our commitment to quality and safety. You can find the wax formula for each candle listed on its product page.</p>",
            "question_3": "Q: “Why is my candle Tunneling?”",
            "answer_3": "<p>When you burn, allow the candle wax to melt to the edges of the glass every time to prevent tunneling. This is especially important during your first burn!</p>",
            "question_4": "Q: “Do you offer Gift Cards?”",
            "answer_4": "<p>Yes! You can find them on our website under Give A Gift &gt; Gift Cards</p>",
            "question_5": "Q: “Can I send my order as a gift?”",
            "answer_5": "<p>Yes, in your shopping cart, select “Add A Gift Message”. Then add recipient, sender, and  gift message.\n</p>",
