        "f4d12560-a07c-4bd4-a934-2a8eddeaccc9": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "title": "SHIPPING AND RETURNS",
            "question_1": "Q: “How long will it take to get my order?”",
            "answer_1": "<p> All of our orders are handpicked and packaged, so we'll let you know as soon as your order ships, which is normally within 1-2 business days. Once your package is picked up by our carrier, transit times typically range between 1-5 business days, depending on delivery destination. You will receive a confirmation email when your label is created. </p>",
            "question_2": "Q: “Do you ship internationally?”",
            "answer_2": "<p>Unfortunately, we do not ship internationally at this time.</p>",
            "question_3": "Q: “Do we offer expedited shipping options?”",
            "answer_3": "<p>Yes, at checkout you can select an expedited shipping option from the dropdown menu.</p>",
            "question_4": "Q: “What if my tracking info doesn't show any updates?”",
            "answer_4": "<p>The tracking status may take 48 hours to update once the order has been processed and the shipping label created. If you haven't received an update after 48 hours, please reach out to our Support team at <a href=\"mailto:orders@jacksonvaughn.com\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">orders@jacksonvaughn.com</a> and we'll be happy to look into it.</p>",
            "question_5": "Q: “What is your return policy?”",
            "answer_5": "<p>All returns must be processed within 30 days of receiving the order. If you are not 100% satisfied with your Jackson Vaughn order, please contact our Support team at orders@jacksonvaughn.com with your order number (found on your order confirmation email) and we’ll help to initiate the return. </p>",
